  "body": "Adds `site/content/guide/mcp.md` (\"AI agents (MCP)\", weight 7) and replaces the two-sentence MCP mentions in `guide/posting.md` and `developers/commands.md` with links to it.\n\nFork synced at v0.18.0 (cut from upstream/main 37482923).\n\nSections: what it is; starting the server; run modes (headless, attached via `--mcp-port` + `--connect`); generic client config; tool groups table; example session; undo/redo; refusals; safety.\n\nSources (verified against upstream/main): `crates/app/src/cli.rs` (`lane_mcp`, `--connect`), `crates/app/src/mcp/listen.rs` (`--mcp-port`, `CAMCRAFT_MCP_PORT`, loopback, one client, 5 min idle), `mcp/tools.rs` `all()` and each `*_tools.rs` table for the tool names, `script/api.rs` `v_post`, `mcp/mod.rs`.\n\nLeft out: tools that exist only in open PRs; per-tool parameter docs (the page points at `tools/list`); any vendor client's config format; per-tool undo-step claims beyond \"each mutating tool is one undo step\".\n\nNot exercised: `zola check` (zola is not installed here), so the `@/` links are unchecked by the tool.\n\nChangelog: none\nEffort: medium\n\nFixes #1247\n",
